                     QUERY PLAN                      
-----------------------------------------------------
 YB Batched Nested Loop Left Join
   Join Filter: (t1.a = t2.a)
   Sort Keys: t1.a
   Filter: ((t1.a >= t2.a) OR (t1.a = 1))
   ->  Index Scan using h_a_idx on h t1
   ->  Index Scan using rk1_pkey on rk1 t2
         Index Cond: (a = ANY (ARRAY[t1.a, $1, $2]))
(7 rows)

