   Join Filter: (r1.a = (NULL::integer))
   ->  Limit
         ->  Index Only Scan using h_ba_idx on h
   ->  Index Scan using rk1_pkey on rk1 r1
         Index Cond: (a = ANY (ARRAY[(NULL::integer), $1, $2, ..., $9]))
(6 rows)

