                                                QUERY PLAN                                                 
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 YB Batched Nested Loop Join
   Join Filter: ((p1.a = p2.a) AND (p1.b = p2.b) AND (p1.c = p2.c))
   ->  Index Scan using test1_pkey on test1 p1
   ->  Index Scan using test2_pkey on test2 p2
