---------------------------------------------------------
 Nested Loop Left Join
   ->  Index Scan using q1_pkey on q1 p1
   ->  Nested Loop
         Join Filter: ((p2.c1 + p3.a) = (p1.c1 + p1.c2))
         ->  Index Only Scan using q3_range on q3 p3
         ->  Index Scan using q2_pkey on q2 p2
               Index Cond: (c1 = p1.c1)
(7 rows)

