         Join Filter: (d.k1 = t.k1)
         ->  Subquery Scan on d
               ->  HashSetOp Intersect All
                     ->  Append
                           ->  Subquery Scan on "*SELECT* 1"
                                 ->  Index Only Scan using bnl_uniq_k1_k2_idx on bnl_uniq
                           ->  Subquery Scan on "*SELECT* 2"
                                 ->  Index Only Scan using bnl_uniq_k1_k2_idx on bnl_uniq bnl_uniq_1
         ->  Index Only Scan using bnl_uniq_k1_k2_idx on bnl_uniq t
               Index Cond: (k1 = ANY (ARRAY[d.k1, $1]))
(12 rows)

